        <icon:inputDescription>Liquid sample and installed stirring tool on a fixed stand; front-knob speed selection and mains power. On/off operation; regulated normal running and overload operation. Fault protection can stop the motor.&#10;Source: H, PDF pp. 6–10, 12 (EUROSTAR 20 digital column).</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>rpm (speed); N·cm (shaft torque); L (water stirring quantity); mPa·s (viscosity); V AC, Hz and W (electrical ratings)&#10;Source: H, PDF pp. 6–10, 12 (EUROSTAR 20 digital column).</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Stirred liquid; shaft rotation and speed display. Normal display reports actual rpm; overload status 1 blinks the target speed; overload status 2 stops rotation with Er 4. Complete electrical signal outputs are not described.&#10;Source: H, PDF pp. 6–10, 12 (EUROSTAR 20 digital column).</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/L"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliPA-SEC"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/REV-PER-MIN"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>451</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
