  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment/M20-03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#EquipmentModel"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/ProductModel"/>
    <dct:identifier>M20-03</dct:identifier>
    <schema:name>MTI OTF-1200X</schema:name>
    <schema:manufacturer rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/manufacturer/mti"/>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment.csv#row=194"/>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/dataset/equipment"/>
    <icon:identity>
      <icon:IdentityProfile rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment/M20-03/identity">
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment.csv#row=194"/>
        <icon:inCategory rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/category/M20"/>
        <icon:recordKind>source_model</icon:recordKind>
      </icon:IdentityProfile>
    </icon:identity>
    <icon:inputOutputProfile>
      <icon:InputOutputProfile rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M20-03">
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv#row=194"/>
        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://mtixtl.com/products/otf1200x"/>
        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://nano-fab.com/secure/otf-1200x/doc/Manual.pdf"/>
        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>Sample and a suitable process tube; vacuum or flowing gas through the installed flanges. Temperature program contains up to 30 temperature/time segments. Power-lock and furnace relay turn on/off; controller commands enter RUN, HOLD/resume or STOP. The series manual calls for a configured 208–240 V single-phase line in 110 V regions. Gas-pressure limits and atmosphere restrictions must follow the exact tube/flange configuration.&#10;Source: Manuals/MTI OTF-1200X__linked-manual__94143f6f5d.pdf, PDF pp. 4, 8, 11–17, 20–21.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (process temperature); min and s (profile/timing parameters); °C/min (heating/cooling rate); V and Hz (supply); atm or MPa (tube-pressure restrictions). The pressure restrictions are engineering limits, not proof of a calibrated pressure-output channel.&#10;Source: Manuals/MTI OTF-1200X__linked-manual__94143f6f5d.pdf, PDF pp. 4, 8, 11–17, 20–21.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Thermally treated sample; PV display shows current chamber temperature and SV shows the programmed value/state. RUN advances segments; HOLD pauses/resumes; STOP halts the program; relay-off removes heater power. Complete remote-I/O pins are not enumerated in this series manual.&#10;Source: Manuals/MTI OTF-1200X__linked-manual__94143f6f5d.pdf, PDF pp. 4, 8, 11–17, 20–21.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG_C"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>685</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
        <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
      </icon:InputOutputProfile>
    </icon:inputOutputProfile>
