        <icon:inputDescription>Substrate, deposition precursors/process gases, RF plasma power, multi-zone temperature program, four-channel gas delivery and vacuum pumping. The linked product is a PE-CVD system, not evidence of an atomic-layer pulsing interface. Tube size and zone count depend on the variant.&#10;Source: I, Overview and model-specific PECVD specifications.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (temperature); W (RF power); mm/inch (tube and zone geometry). Other flow/pressure units require the configured subsystem specification.&#10;Source: I, Overview and model-specific PECVD specifications.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>PECVD-deposited material/coated substrate; the page names nanowires and graphene as applications. Complete film-property predictions, data outputs and discrete controller-state mappings are not supplied.&#10;Source: I, Overview and model-specific PECVD specifications.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG_C"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/W"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>686</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
        <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
      </icon:InputOutputProfile>
    </icon:inputOutputProfile>
