        <icon:inputDescription>Compatible gas, electrical supply and flow setpoint. EL-FLOW Select family manual describes analog/digital remote control and RS-232; other fieldbus interfaces depend on the ordered option. Normally-closed and normally-open valve constructions are alternatives, not interchangeable states of every unit. F-200CV-specific full-scale range is not established here.&#10;Source: H, PDF pp. 8–11 (EL-FLOW Select family).</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>mLₙ/min and Lₙ/min (normalized gas flow); bar (pressure). Other interface units/scaling are configuration-dependent.&#10;Source: H, PDF pp. 8–11 (EL-FLOW Select family).</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Measured/controlled gas flow plus diagnostics, alarms and counters; analog/digital communication depends on the ordered interface. Exact scaling, valve option and complete signal-state map require the serial-label configuration.&#10;Source: H, PDF pp. 8–11 (EL-FLOW Select family).</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:sourceRow>165</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
