        <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Sample prepared in the specified measurement cell; optical/electrophoretic measurement conditions.&#10;Documented parameters/utilities: Electrical stimulus (mV), Temperature setting/range (°C).&#10;Interfaces named: USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.&#10;Source-described sample/feed form: liquid sample.&#10;Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.&#10;Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 81, 174.&#10;Additional documented controls/states: start/stop controls.&#10;Source: Manuals/Malvern Zetasizer Nano ZS__linked-manual__4bcf5b5713.pdf, PDF p. 31, 55.</icon:inputDescription>
