        <icon:outputDescription>Particle-size/scattering measurements; zeta potential only where this model/configuration documents it.&#10;Source-listed channels/measurands: particle size, size distribution, zeta potential, polydispersity, PDI, diffusion coefficient.&#10;Status terms explicitly described: running, standby.&#10;Other output-state/pin mappings: not established by this functional summary.&#10;Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 81, 174.</icon:outputDescription>
