        <icon:outputDescription>Particle-size/scattering measurements; zeta potential only where this model/configuration documents it. Documented readouts/functions: hydrodynamic diameter, zeta potential, polydispersity index. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.&#10;Source: Manuals/SZ-100_Brochure.pdf, PDF p. 1, 4, 8.</icon:outputDescription>
