        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://jascoinc.com/products/spectroscopy/uv-visible-nir-spectrophotometers/specifications/"/>
        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>Sample/reference optical measurement with wavelength/scan program; Start control. V-730 uses a double-beam single-monochromator system, 190–1100 nm range and 1 nm bandwidth. Cell/material compatibility and complete input-state guards are not given.&#10;Source: I, V-730 section of the model-comparison specification table.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>nm (wavelength/bandwidth); nm/min (scanning); Abs (absorbance); %T (transmittance); s (measurement time); VA (power requirement)&#10;Source: I, V-730 section of the model-comparison specification table.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Absorbance/transmittance readings, spectrum, time course, fixed-wavelength and quantitative-analysis results. Analog output is listed; its electrical scaling/states are not specified.&#10;Source: I, V-730 section of the model-comparison specification table.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoM"/>
