        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Aerosol feed and sheath/carrier flow; classification settings.&#10;Documented parameters/utilities: Flow setting/range (L/min), Gas/air supply (L/min), Temperature setting/range (K; °C), Pressure setting/range (kPa).&#10;Interfaces named: Ethernet, LAN, RS-232, USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.&#10;Source-described sample/feed form: gas stream.&#10;Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.&#10;Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 29, 64, 114.</icon:inputDescription>
