        <icon:inputDescription>Metal powder and build plate for laser powder-bed fusion; build geometry/program and process settings. The inventory identifies two AM400 units. The local DOCX is only a gated system-overview preview, so its brief laser-power claim is not used as an operating or signal specification.&#10;Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx, Fabrication / Renishaw AM400 entry.</icon:inputDescription>
