        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>Laser: 400 W pulsed fiber laser; Layer Thickness 20 to 100 µm;Build Volume 250 × 250 × 300 mm;Atmosphere Argon, low O₂ (&lt; 100 ppm)</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Additively manufactured metal components/test specimens. Controller telemetry, alarms and electrical output states remain unestablished without the actual AM400 manual.&#10;Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx, Fabrication / Renishaw AM400 entry.</icon:outputDescription>
