        <icon:inputDescription>Metal powder feed, substrate/build plate and CAD/build instructions; hybrid processing also requires milling tools and a machining program. The inventory describes laser powder-bed fusion combined with subtractive machining. The reactive configuration and its gas, interlock and control limits are not specified by the linked standard-product page.&#10;Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>W (laser-power specification on the linked standard LUMEX Avance-25 page). The page lists a standard 500 W laser; applicability to the existing/reactive inventory configurations is unconfirmed. Other operating/measurement units were not recovered from this page.&#10;Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Hybrid additively built and milled metal component. The inventory identifies specimen/part fabrication; detailed process telemetry and ready/alarm outputs require the installed controller manual.&#10;Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:sourceRow>15</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
