  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment/REQ-EQ-009">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#EquipmentModel"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/ProductModel"/>
    <dct:identifier>REQ-EQ-009</dct:identifier>
    <schema:name>FormAlloy L2</schema:name>
    <schema:manufacturer rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/manufacturer/formalloy"/>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment.csv#row=599"/>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/dataset/equipment"/>
    <icon:identity>
      <icon:IdentityProfile rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment/REQ-EQ-009/identity">
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment.csv#row=599"/>
        <icon:inCategory rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/category/X-AM"/>
        <icon:recordKind>commercial_model</icon:recordKind>
      </icon:IdentityProfile>
    </icon:identity>
    <icon:inputOutputProfile>
      <icon:InputOutputProfile rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-009">
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv#row=595"/>
        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://www.osti.gov/pages/servlets/purl/1981108"/>
        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>Metal powder feed, substrate and laser toolpath/G-code; the cited experiment uses Inconel 625 powder (45–106 µm). The reported L2 configuration has a 2 kW CW fibre laser with a 1.2 mm spot. Set/recorded process inputs include laser power, XYZ position, A/C angles, scan velocity, powder-disc speed, shield/carrier-gas flow and infill/contour flags (0/1). These are the study configuration, not guaranteed limits of the Purdue machine.&#10;Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>s (time); mm and µm (position/spot/powder size); mm/min (scan velocity); degrees (A/C axes); W or kW (laser power); J/mm² (derived specific laser energy density); °C (enclosure temperature); rpm (powder-disc speed); L/min (shield/carrier gas); Hz (logging rate); layer index and 0/1 flags (dimensionless)&#10;Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Deposited metal part. In the documented L2 sensing configuration, logged outputs include elapsed program time, layer number, infill/contour flags, feed velocity, XYZ/A/C position, laser power, melt-pool diameter, enclosure temperature, powder-disc speed and gas flows. Melt-pool sensing requires the study’s installed monitoring hardware; later CT porosity is an external test, not an L2 output.&#10;Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG_C"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/HZ"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/L-PER-MIN"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliM-PER-MIN"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/REV-PER-MIN"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/SEC"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>10</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
        <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
      </icon:InputOutputProfile>
    </icon:inputOutputProfile>
    <icon:associations>
      <icon:CatalogAssociations rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment/REQ-EQ-009/associations">
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment.csv#row=599"/>
        <icon:associationBasis>curated supplement; material/process links are proposed context, not verified model capability</icon:associationBasis>
      </icon:CatalogAssociations>
