        <icon:modelEvidenceStatus>documented</icon:modelEvidenceStatus>
        <icon:modelStatus>documented_requested_entry</icon:modelStatus>
        <icon:notes>Bulk metal deposition; nanocomposite processing would require independent validation. Institution confirms L2 and says SOP provided after training; SOP not public manufacturer manual. Photo review 2026-10-15: Purdue lab facility sheet explicitly labels its customized L2. Image is an institutional reference configuration, not an assertion that it is this inventory unit. JHU image with an X5 filename was not used.</icon:notes>
        <icon:priceStatus>not_researched</icon:priceStatus>
        <icon:reviewDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-13</icon:reviewDate>
