        <icon:notes>Do not assign specifications of the AM HWD variant to this base machine. Manufacturer product page confirms machine; brochures/presentations excluded. Do not conflate with AM HWD hybrid variant. Review 2026-10-14: Official Mazak VC-500A/5X virtual showroom page located; no verified photo or public exact MSRP added. Deep-link review 2026-10-14: Official model presentation includes VC-500A/5X specifications; not an operator manual. Link repair 2026-10-15: Retired virtual.mazakusa.com URLs replaced by the current US VC Series brochure request page and an official customer article confirming the base VC-500A/5X. No AM HWD specifications or photo have been assigned. No new MSRP or manual verification asserted.</icon:notes>
