        <icon:inputDescription>Tool/workpiece load and motion commands through the specified FANUC RJ2/RJ3 controller. The LR Mate 200i is a six-axis arm; cart interfaces and the full electrical I/O map are not described by this arm-only seller specification.&#10;Source: I, LR Mate 200i Details, Motion Speed and Motion Range.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>kg (payload); mm (reach); ° and rad (joint angles); °/s and rad/s (joint speeds)&#10;Source: I, LR Mate 200i Details, Motion Speed and Motion Range.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Six-axis tool motion; absolute serial encoder position feedback and wrist end-effector connection are described. Axis brakes and solenoid valve pack are listed, but their command/state mapping is not supplied.&#10;Source: I, LR Mate 200i Details, Motion Speed and Motion Range.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliM"/>
