        <icon:catalogScope>requested_supplement</icon:catalogScope>
        <icon:lifecycle>
          <icon:ModelLifecycle rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment/REQ-EQ-015/review/lifecycle">
            <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/model_lifecycle.csv#row=604"/>
            <icon:lifecycleStatus>model_unresolved</icon:lifecycleStatus>
            <icon:reviewNotes>Current LR Mate 200iD family exists, but the requested LR_Mate200i + CART lacks a precise arm/controller/cart configuration. No complete-system successor is assigned.</icon:reviewNotes>
            <icon:successorCheckedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-15</icon:successorCheckedDate>
            <icon:successorEvidenceUrl rdf:resource="https://www.fanucamerica.com/products/robots/series/lr-mate"/>
          </icon:ModelLifecycle>
        </icon:lifecycle>
        <icon:manualMatchStatus>not_verified</icon:manualMatchStatus>
        <icon:manualStatus>configuration_unresolved</icon:manualStatus>
        <icon:modelEvidenceStatus>candidate_needs_review</icon:modelEvidenceStatus>
        <icon:modelStatus>user_requested_not_verified</icon:modelStatus>
        <icon:notes>LR Mate generation and cart integration unspecified; arm-only instructions do not cover the cart. Retain exact unsuffixed 200i and cart configuration. 200iC/200iD manuals do not establish coverage; controller/cart integration unidentified. Photo review 2026-10-15: Robots.com documents the legacy unsuffixed LR Mate 200i arm; linked as supplier specifications only. Cart, controller and exact installation remain unresolved. Current 200iD photograph was not substituted.</icon:notes>
        <icon:priceStatus>not_researched</icon:priceStatus>
        <icon:reviewDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-13</icon:reviewDate>
      </icon:ReviewProfile>
    </icon:review>
