        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment.csv#row=615"/>
        <icon:equipmentSubtype>Mobile dual-arm assembly; prototype configuration</icon:equipmentSubtype>
        <icon:inCategory rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/category/M62"/>
        <icon:legacyCategoryID>X-ROB</icon:legacyCategoryID>
        <icon:recordKind>prototype_configuration</icon:recordKind>
      </icon:IdentityProfile>
    </icon:identity>
    <icon:inputOutputProfile>
      <icon:InputOutputProfile rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-026">
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv#row=611"/>
        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://franka.de/hubfs/MobileFR3Duo_TwoPager_February%202026.pdf?hsLang=en"/>
        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://frankarobotics.github.io/docs/"/>
        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>Payloads/end effectors for two FR3 arms and the mobile base; teleoperation or learned-policy commands through the integrated software. The manufacturer sheet lists 3 kg payload per arm, 100 kg base payload, maximum base speed 1.75 m/s and 1 kHz FCI. Wi-Fi, Ethernet, USB and Bluetooth are listed. Installed controller commands, safety-state guards and utility/power ratings are not enumerated in this two-page sheet.&#10;Source: I, Mobile FR3 Duo manufacturer sheet, PDF pp. 1–2.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>kg (arm/base payload); m/s (base travel speed); kHz (FCI frequency). Detailed torque, pose, image and IMU output units are not stated in the linked product sheet.&#10;Source: I, Mobile FR3 Duo manufacturer sheet, PDF pp. 1–2.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Coordinated dual-arm motion and omnidirectional base motion; sensing includes 14 arm-torque sensors, two lidars, seven cameras and one IMU. The exact raw signal fields, sensor units/scaling and ready/error states require the installed FCI/sensor documentation.&#10;Source: I, Mobile FR3 Duo manufacturer sheet, PDF pp. 1–2.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M-PER-SEC"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>11</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
        <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
      </icon:InputOutputProfile>
    </icon:inputOutputProfile>
