        <icon:inputDescription>Mechanical-test specimen and a temperature target/thermal program for the laser-heating add-on. It is a heating accessory, not the load-frame actuator; the linked temperature brochure does not enumerate its full power/control interfaces.&#10;Source: I, PDF p. 1, temperature-control options.</icon:inputDescription>
