        <icon:notes>CARBIDE CB1-04 identity requires generation-specific documentation; do not substitute a CB3 manual. Exact CB1-04 identity supported by industry product directory only; primary exact-model evidence/manual unresolved. No current CARBIDE family manual inferred. Review 2026-10-14: Current manufacturer CARBIDE family page covers CB3/CB5. The photo shows CB3, not the requested CB1-04.</icon:notes>
