    <icon:inputOutputProfile>
      <icon:InputOutputProfile rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-042">
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv#row=626"/>
        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://www.universal-robots.com/manuals/EN/HTML/SW5_20/Content/prod-usr-man/complianceUR12e/H_g5_sections/appendix_g5/tech_spec_data_12e.htm"/>
        <dct:source rdf:resource="https://www.universal-robots.com/manuals/EN/PDF/SW5_25_1/user-manual-UR12e-PDF_online/733-429-00_UR12e_User_Manual_en_Global.pdf"/>
        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>End effector and workpiece: Tool/workpiece load within the model payload and center-of-gravity envelope; states: Configured payload and center of gravity; workpiece state depends on attached tool; phase: Not prescribed by robot manual&#10;Control-box digital/safety/configurable inputs: PNP; input voltage −3–30 V; states: OFF region −3–5 V; ON region 11–30 V; 5–11 V is not a valid guaranteed logic region&#10;Control-box analog inputs: Voltage mode 0–10 V or current mode 4–20 mA; 12-bit resolution; states: Voltage/current mode selected in GUI&#10;Tool digital inputs: PNP with weak pull-down; floating input reads LOW; states: LOW ≤2.0 V; HIGH ≥5.5 V within permitted input range −0.5–26 V&#10;Robot motion/program configuration: Joint/TCP moves, payload and tool/installation settings in PolyScope; states: Program/installation dependent; this extract does not enumerate all PolyScope commands or safety functions&#10;Additional documented controls/states: manual/automatic operating mode, remote/local control.&#10;Source: Manuals/Universal Robots UR12e__linked-manual__76e09f695d.pdf, PDF p. 21, 25.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>A; V; bit; joint count; kg; m/s; mA; mm; °; °/s; Ω</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Control-box analog outputs: Voltage mode 0–10 V or current mode 4–20 mA; 12-bit resolution; states: Voltage/current output mode selected; range and load constraints apply&#10;Control-box digital outputs: PNP; current 0–1 A with specified loads; states: HIGH/LOW; voltage drop and leakage limits given in manual&#10;Tool digital outputs: Sinking NPN, sourcing PNP or push/pull; states: NPN active=LOW/inactive=open; PNP active=HIGH/inactive=open; push/pull active=HIGH/inactive=LOW; emergency stop=high impedance&#10;Tool power supply: Selectable 0/12/24 V; specified single-/dual-pin current limits; states: Off, 12 V or 24 V; dual-pin mode changes output-pin availability&#10;Tool/workpiece motion: Six-joint robot motion within configured workspace; states: Trajectory and stop conditions are program/safety-configuration dependent; phase: Workpiece phase is not prescribed</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M-PER-SEC"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliA"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliM"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/OHM"/>
