        <icon:inputDescription>Sample plate: Loaded compatible plate and its liquid samples; states: Labware loaded or absent; sample chemistry is protocol-specific; phase: Liquid samples in wells&#10;Block temperature target: 4–99 °C; states: Numeric target; blocking and concurrent variants are documented&#10;Lid temperature target: 37–110 °C; states: Heater enabled at target or deactivated; lowering target uses passive cooling&#10;Temperature profile: Temperature/hold-time steps; repetition count; block_max_volume; states: Ordered profile steps; 25 µL default block_max_volume is an API parameter, not machine capacity&#10;API control methods: open_lid, close_lid, set/start_set_lid_temperature, set/start_set_block_temperature, execute/start_execute_profile, deactivate/deactivate_block/deactivate_lid; states: Open/close requests; configure/run; controller active/deactivated; API-version dependent</icon:inputDescription>
