        <icon:inputDescription>Compatible fully skirted plates, lids or tip racks and Flex protocol movement commands; open/close jaw commands and gantry positioning. Jaws use a 36 VDC motor. Calibration uses the provided pin; permitted labware depends on the library definition.&#10;Source: I, Gripper, Gripper specifications and Gripper calibration (H quickstart supports labware compatibility).</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>V DC (jaw motor); position/force display units are not specified in these sections.&#10;Source: I, Gripper, Gripper specifications and Gripper calibration (H quickstart supports labware compatibility).</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Gripped/released and relocated labware; jaw states open/closed and robot-computed calibration position. Full force-sensor, electrical-state and telemetry mappings are not supplied by these linked sections.&#10;Source: I, Gripper, Gripper specifications and Gripper calibration (H quickstart supports labware compatibility).</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/V"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>745</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
