        <icon:inputDescription>Balanced specimen tubes and compatible rotor; speed or RCF setting; temperature and run-time selection including HOLD and RTC scheduling. Listed controls include 0–40 °C rotor temperature and 1 min–99 h 59 min timed operation. Supply is AC 100 V ±10 V, 15 A, 50/60 Hz.&#10;Source: I, Japanese operating features and specifications table.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>rpm (speed); ×g (RCF); min/h (time); °C (temperature); mL (rotor/tube volume); V, A and Hz (supply)&#10;Source: I, Japanese operating features and specifications table.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Centrifuged fractions; touchscreen speed, run-time and temperature readings; centrifugation records exported as CSV by USB. Imbalance detection stops the run. Detailed signal-pin states are not provided.&#10;Source: I, Japanese operating features and specifications table.</icon:outputDescription>
