            <dct:description>Online-exclusive price for ONE 10.5 m sales roll of 22 mm I.D., 10K MWCO dialysis tubing; displayed reference price $237.00. Not an assembled dialysis system or one single-use length. Manufacturer web price, not labeled MSRP; US/USD display checked 2026-10-16.</dct:description>
