        <icon:notes>Passive dialysis component/consumable. Select membrane MWCO and chemical compatibility for the intended solvent exchange; not validated as a replacement for the exact reported lignin self-assembly apparatus. Product page specifies 10.5 m; current family user guide rounds the roll to 10.7 m (35 ft). Check pack labeling. Market alternative; no Purdue inventory ownership or exact literature replication claimed. Complete solvent-exchange assembly also needs compatible vessels, liquid exchange and any required mixing. Sales-pack price is not a full-system or per-piece price.</icon:notes>
