        <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Sample/load in the chamber/tube; programmed heating and atmosphere connections where documented.&#10;Documented parameters/utilities: Temperature setting/range (°C).&#10;Interfaces named: Ethernet, USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.&#10;Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.&#10;Sources: I PDF pp. 1.</icon:inputDescription>
