        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>Powder/material in a selected pressing die; hand-operated separate hydraulic pump and cylinder. Transparent safety cover; optional electric/programmed pumps are separate configurations, not base-model controls. The source contains conflicting cylinder-travel figures, so no travel limit is assigned.&#10;Source: I, YLJ-24TS specifications and gauge-to-force conversion.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>MPa (gauge pressure); metric tonne-force (applied force convention); mm/cm (die/cylinder geometry); °C (operating environment). m/s² appears only as a gravity constant in the conversion formula.&#10;Source: I, YLJ-24TS specifications and gauge-to-force conversion.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Pressed sample/compact and built-in hydraulic-pressure gauge indication. Applied force is calculated from the listed gauge conversion; the base press does not itself report a digital sample-force signal. No electrical/data-output states are specified.&#10;Source: I, YLJ-24TS specifications and gauge-to-force conversion.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MegaPA"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>690</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
        <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
      </icon:InputOutputProfile>
