        <icon:inputDescription>Aerosol stream and silica-gel desiccant in the DDU 570/L; ambient-pressure operation, not overpressure service. Desiccant state: orange=dry/usable, pale colourless=loaded and to be replaced/regenerated.&#10;Source: I, German datasheet, PDF pp. 1–2.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (ambient/aerosol temperature); g (desiccant mass); mm (hose connection). Flow/measurement display units are not stated for this variant.&#10;Source: I, German datasheet, PDF pp. 1–2.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Dried aerosol stream; no direct contact between aerosol and desiccant. Desiccant colour provides the listed qualitative saturation indication; no electrical/data signal outputs are specified.&#10;Source: I, German datasheet, PDF pp. 1–2.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG_C"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/GM"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>1028</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
        <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
