        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (temperature); g (casting charge); mm (mould geometry); bar (vacuum/overpressure); V and kW (power)&#10;Source: I, PDF pp. 7–8, MC-series model comparison.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Cast metal workpiece; LCD display of program data and documented temperature/process information. Exact signal-output scaling and pin states are not supplied by the catalog.&#10;Source: I, PDF pp. 7–8, MC-series model comparison.</icon:outputDescription>
