        <icon:inputDescription>Hot workpiece and oil or water bath; combination D models have separate oil/water compartments. Manual charging or optional charging aids/coolers/heaters depend on the ordered setup. A lid, supply and drain connections are described; the catalog does not enumerate an electrical state machine.&#10;Source: I, PDF p. 86, Quenching and Cleaning Baths model table.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>L (bath volume); kg (load); kg/h (quenching performance). Optional accessories use °C, V, kW and, for the stated pneumatic charging aid, bar.&#10;Source: I, PDF p. 86, Quenching and Cleaning Baths model table.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Quenched/cooled workpiece. The catalog specifies bath capacity/load and optional cooling/heating equipment, not measured microstructure, a logged cooling curve or signal-output states.&#10;Source: I, PDF p. 86, Quenching and Cleaning Baths model table.</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM"/>
        <icon:reportedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/L"/>
        <icon:sourceRow>706</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
