        <icon:notes>Manufacturer explicitly offers manual configurations in its 304 stainless-steel solvent-station family. This is a documented configured product family, not a fabricated numerical model. Acetone/IPA/photoresist stripping applications documented. No numeric public price; quotation required. Does not establish gel solvent exchange or nanoparticle washing compatibility. Manufacturer documents solvent/acetone/IPA and photoresist-stripping applications for this family. Solvent-processing eligibility is family-level and requires configured chemistry, exhaust, interlocks and fire-protection review.</icon:notes>
