        <icon:importedDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
        <icon:inputDescription>14 analog inputs (AIN0–AIN13); 20 configurable digital I/O; USB power/host commands; gain/channel configuration and timer/counter inputs. Digital input states: LOW −0.3–0.8 V, HIGH 2–5.8 V; analog input range depends on gain. No material feed is used.&#10;Source: H, U6 datasheet §2 and Appendix A (linked subsections).&#10;https://support.labjack.com/docs/2-hardware-description-u6-datasheet ; https://support.labjack.com/docs/appendix-a-specifications-u6-datasheet</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>V, mV/µV, mA/µA/nA; Ω/kΩ/GΩ; Hz/MHz; s/ms/µs; bits, counts, edges/s, %, ppm/°C and °C (as applicable to the measured/configured channel)&#10;Source: H, U6 datasheet §2 and Appendix A (linked subsections).&#10;https://support.labjack.com/docs/2-hardware-description-u6-datasheet ; https://support.labjack.com/docs/appendix-a-specifications-u6-datasheet</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>USB measurement data; DAC0/DAC1 analog outputs; configurable digital outputs/PWM/timers; VS supply and 10/200 µA current-source outputs. Digital output states HIGH/LOW are load-dependent; nominal no-load HIGH is 3.3 V and LOW 0 V.&#10;Source: H, U6 datasheet §2 and Appendix A (linked subsections).&#10;https://support.labjack.com/docs/2-hardware-description-u6-datasheet ; https://support.labjack.com/docs/appendix-a-specifications-u6-datasheet</icon:outputDescription>
        <icon:sourceRow>591</icon:sourceRow>
        <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
        <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
