        <icon:inputDescription>Free-flowing material in the hopper; vibration-amplitude/feed-rate setting through the control unit. Optional L-24 extended controller provides gravimetric dosing/counting; that option is distinguished from the basic feeder.&#10;Source: I, Working Principle and gravimetric-dosing option.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>g/min (material feed rate); other controller/display units are not specified here.&#10;Source: I, Working Principle and gravimetric-dosing option.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Uniform directed stream of bulk material into a receiving mill, divider or mixer. Optional gravimetric dosing/counting requires the extended controller; electrical output states are not enumerated.&#10;Source: I, Working Principle and gravimetric-dosing option.</icon:outputDescription>
