        <icon:notes>Legacy FEI exact600 model is distinct from600i and later Helios families. No current manufacturer-hosted exact600 sales page found. FEI-authored multi-model manual includes600 and is hosted by University of Florida. MIT confirms installed exact model. Broad M38 fits SEM inspection only; do not force ion machining into M59 or current plasma-etch subtypes.  FEI Company Helios NanoLab400/400S/400ML/600 User Operation Manual, University-of-Florida mirror. Includes exact600 but not proof every option applies. Endpoint200 application/pdf. No verified current US machine purchase price. Facility usage rates are excluded. Optional characterization candidates do not change required process steps.</icon:notes>
