        <icon:inputDescription>Specimen and nanoindentation probe; loading/indentation test. The listed TI 950 applies/measures loads from 10 µN to 10 mN and has a maximum measurable depth of 5 µm. Utilities and command-state definitions are not supplied.&#10;Source: I, MIT instrument description.</icon:inputDescription>
        <icon:inputOutputStatus>catalog_io_row</icon:inputOutputStatus>
        <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>µN and mN (load); µm (indentation depth)&#10;Source: I, MIT instrument description.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
        <icon:outputDescription>Indentation load/depth measurements and calculated reduced elastic modulus and hardness. The source does not enumerate electrical output states or export interfaces.&#10;Source: I, MIT instrument description.</icon:outputDescription>
