    <icon:scope>In-line quadrupole mass-analysis/filter accessory for NanoStream sources. Manufacturer product claims only. P/N links express curator relevance, not source-article apparatus, measured performance, exact host compatibility or mandatory process steps. In-line quadrupole accessory for NanoStream beams; the manufacturer image filename MFS is not a second model. Webpage mass-limit exponent is corrupted; refer to NanoStream brochure pages 4 and 6 instead. No aerosol-mobility or general mass-spectrometer equivalence. Public purchase price and exact-model operating manual were not published in this bounded review. No documented successor relationship or newest-generation claim. No make/model match in the user-designated Purdue list; generic PVD wording is not asset identity.</icon:scope>
