    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_catalog</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>UHV sample-stage components/accessories, not complete vacuum deposition systems. Manufacturer product claims only. P/N links express curator relevance, not source-article apparatus, measured performance, exact host compatibility or mandatory process steps. Product text explicitly identifies a 30-position stage, heating up to 500 degrees C and DC bias up to 4000 V. These are supplier hardware capabilities, not process settings or an extracted position/fiber/direction interface. Photo is generic SMPL-family hardware; exact MH4i identity is not established. Do not conflate this 30-position stage with the separate 25-sample option on the UHV systems page. Mismatched atom-source brochure excluded. Public purchase price and exact-model operating manual were not published in this bounded review. No documented successor relationship or newest-generation claim. No make/model match in the user-designated Purdue list; generic PVD wording is not asset identity.</icon:scope>
  </icon:SourceEvidence>
