        <icon:checkedDate>2026-10-18</icon:checkedDate>
        <icon:sourceLocator>Configured Thermo Scientific Nicolet 8700 setup supports infrared PL/transmission/absorption/reflection, several detector materials spanning about 800 nmâ€“10 Âµm, step-scan attachments, Janis ST-500 or Oxford liquid-helium cryostats, Nicolet Continuum microscopy and electrical I-V/C-V integration.</icon:sourceLocator>
