    <icon:claim>Lid target temperature is an integer from 37 to 110 degrees Celsius. set_lid_temperature is blocking and returns when the target is reached; cooling is passive.</icon:claim>
    <icon:classification>manufacturer_fact</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Model-bound control documentation; not a validation of a user sequence.</icon:scope>
