    <icon:associationBasis>Reviewed methods of 10.1038/s41467-020-19597-w. Reported 20 nm libraries and nanometre SbTe regions. CAMEO automates characterization selection, not synthesis; no autonomous sputtering claim. Theris 2026-10-18 catalogue links are curator capability/auxiliary associations; source step requirements and source-reported apparatus remain unchanged. Exact configuration and process suitability require review.</icon:associationBasis>
