    <icon:associationBasis>Reviewed methods of 10.1021/acsomega.7b00759. Cu-doped ZnO films include 50–100 nm surface domes at the stated low-Cu composition; higher-Cu features extend above 100 nm. Hop 2 via the directly cited 2024 review. Curator-added M82–M88 planning alternatives are distinguished from the article-reported apparatus; exact-model compatibility is not established.</icon:associationBasis>
    <icon:sourcePage>Experimental Section &gt; Deposition Procedure (JATS sec4.1); Results and Discussion &gt; Material Characterization (sec2.1), Figure2</icon:sourcePage>
